      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Great, now I want stickers/emojis/items that change depending on your rank/tenure, would be a cool gimmick. At least more fun then telling people to check my account's badges.\n\nAlso, imagine just tossing a unique \"verified 18+\" emoji at some silly club bouncer when they ask you your age and date of birth, would be funny. (Of course would have to be somewhat fancy so people can't just make a custom emoji that looks like it.)",
